error[E0214]: cannot convert i64 to str[8]
 --> tests/errors/E0214_resize.al:6:11
  |
6 |     print(str[8](n));
  |           ^^^^^^^^^
  = hint: str[8](s) changes the capacity of a str; to turn a value into text, append it: var s: str[8] = ""; append(mut s, n);

